cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "ppg-pda-analysis: pulse decomposition analysis of the photoplethysmogram and its validity as a vascular index"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and frozen pre-registrations for a research programme testing whether
  indices derived from pulse decomposition analysis of the photoplethysmogram carry
  vascular information, and whether they can correct pulse-wave-transit-time-based
  cardiac output estimation. Contains the frozen decomposition, the derived indices,
  the comparators, the VitalDB and Pulse Wave Database analysis scripts, and the
  statistical analysis plans as frozen before the confirmatory analyses.
  No patient data are included.
type: software
authors:
